# Taglines

On-voice lines, grouped by where they run. Pick one, do not stack three. A
headline earns its space by being specific — prefer the line that names a real
thing over the line that could belong to any company.

## Master positioning

> **Enterprise AI infrastructure and frontier models.**

The canonical descriptor (from `brand.json`). Use verbatim in meta descriptions,
app-store blurbs, and anywhere a single neutral sentence is needed.

