## Rules

- ≤ 7 words for a hero headline; ≤ 140 characters for a subline.
- Sentence case. No trailing exclamation. No emoji.
- A tagline states a fact or a capability, never a feeling. "The AI cloud for
  builders" is a claim you can test. "Amazing AI experiences" is not — do not
  ship it.
